<section class="hub-group" id="hub-play-cards" aria-label="Play"><ul class="hub-grid"><li><a class="hub-card" href="/games"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/pythian-games.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">Nineteen games</span><span class="hub-card-t">Games</span><span class="hub-card-d">Picture puzzles, word hunts, timelines, the ranks of past societies, a globe, a daily Connections and a daily Crossword: games with real pictures and real dates, for every age.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/quiz"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/rosetta-stone.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">New every day</span><span class="hub-card-t">History Quiz</span><span class="hub-card-d">Guess the empire, person, event or place from four clues, or practise as long as you like.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/today"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/astrolabe.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">Every day</span><span class="hub-card-t">Today at the Institute</span><span class="hub-card-d">The day in one place: its anniversary, the people born on it, the song of the day and the daily games.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/flashcards"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/house-of-wisdom.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">11,746 cards</span><span class="hub-card-t">Flashcards</span><span class="hub-card-d">Terms, faces, capitals and dates in decks of cards: the ones you miss come back sooner, the ones you know wait longer.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/write"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/rosetta-stone.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">12 languages</span><span class="hub-card-t">Write in Ancient Scripts</span><span class="hub-card-d">Cuneiform, hieroglyphs, Linear B, runes, Brahmi and more: a keyboard that shows every sign with its sound, and your writing as a picture.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/race"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/charioteer-of-delphi.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">556 to race</span><span class="hub-card-t">Rise and Fall Race</span><span class="hub-card-d">Up to four states and empires race year by year: who led, when they overtook each other and how long each held on.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/kids"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/great-pyramid-of-giza.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">For young explorers</span><span class="hub-card-t">Kids corner</span><span class="hub-card-d">Pyramids, knights, Vikings and explorers: picture stories, a fact of the day and games for younger readers.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/passport"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/xuanzang.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">Your stamps</span><span class="hub-card-t">My Passport</span><span class="hub-card-d">The pages you read, the centuries you visit and the games you play, with stamps to collect. Kept in your own browser.</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
